{
  "info": {
    "name": "api",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Booking API local collection. Set url and business_id. QueryRoomCategories -> select room_category_id -> CreateCustomer -> QueryReservations -> CreateBooking -> QueryBooking. Staff fixture: CreateBusiness -> CreateRoomCategory -> CreateRoom. Optional quantity must be an integer from 1\u20134 (omission defaults to 1); non-RACING categories accept only 1 or omission. The server resolves category ownership/acronym. RACING assigns distinct machines continuously free for the full interval, ordered by sort order/name/ID, even for quantity 1. Confirmed and unexpired pending bookings block overlaps; adjacent intervals, cancelled bookings and expired holds do not. Insufficient capacity returns 409 before writes. One booking has N reservation rows and one unchanged upfront payment flow. Other categories retain the temporary assignment bypass. The response still temporarily returns payment_url: null. Concurrency protection and atomicity remain deferred. Date reservation queries include overlapping intervals; range queries retain contained intervals. All reservation queries require business_id. Payment flow and alternatives remain as documented on individual requests. Concurrency, atomicity, finalized payment enforcement and late-payment policies are deferred. Do not run alternative payment outcomes on the same booking. No credentials are exported."
  },
